MODULE: TimerReservedSlotSingleSlotNoHold
TARGET: TimerReservedSlot
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a single-slot timer ignores an outstanding sweep refusal
PERTURBS: TimerDispatchDrive
BOUNDS: Ceiling = 2

--- FIND
    /\ IF ~deleted /\ leaf[l].drive = "none" /\ CanAdmit("timer")
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no refusal-window headroom in the single-slot corner.
    /\ IF ~deleted /\ leaf[l].drive = "none" /\ free > 0 /\ Cardinality(Running) < Share
--- END
